note The archived pt-island driver is a dangling path, so the quench controls are the LJ38 forward-difference set. The stop is this problem's Euclidean force norm. orthogZeroEigs is unset because the substrate fixes the frame. The initial eigenvector is the free displacement from the reactant. A converged candidate also pays for the transverse mode screen.
